{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","DocumentFunctionCodeList","Document function","Purpose of the document.","Functional identifier","Identification of a specific information exchange.","Document reference number, assigned by the Trader","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","Document usage code","Code specifying whether the document (e.g. permit, bond, license) is for single use or multiple use.","User code list","ObligationGuarantee","Details related to the undertaking given in cash, bond or as a written guarantee to ensure that an obligation will be fulfilled (e.g. under a transit procedure).","Document effective date/time","Date and time of effectiveness of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate, bond).","Document expiration date/time","Date and time of expiration of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate, bond).","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Guarantee amount","Amount indicating the total value of the guarantee.","Guarantee activity type code","Code specifying the type of activity being guaranteed.","Guarantee reference identifier","Identification of the undertaking given as a written guarantee in cash, bond, or by other such means in order to ensure that an obligation will be fulfilled by reference number.","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Document category code","Code specifying the category of a document.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","Principal","Details related to a party (i.e., Principal, Co-principal, or User) who is responsible for fulfilling the obligations covered by the Customs bond or who benefits from being able to obligate a Customs bond.","Principal name","Name of the party (i.e., Principal, Co-principal, or User) who is responsible for fulfilling the obligations covered by the Customs bond or who benefits from being able to obligate a Customs bond.","Principal identifier","Identification of the party (i.e., Principal, Co-principal, or User) who is responsible for fulfilling the obligations covered by the Customs bond or who benefits from being able to obligate a Customs bond.","International code list (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User code list","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","Principal rider action code","Code specifying the bond user rider action.","Principal add date/time","Date and time the bond user is added to the bond.","Principal delete date/time","Date and time the bond user is removed from the bond.","NotifyParty","Details related to the party to be notified.","Notify party identifier","Identification of a party to be notified.","Surety","Details related to the natural or legal person who accepts responsibility in due legal form for the financial consequences of non-fulfillment of another's obligations to the Customs (CCC).","Surety name","Name of the party who agrees to be responsible for the debt or obligation of another.","Surety identifier","Identification of the party who agrees to be responsible for the debt or obligation of another.","Surety liability amount","Amount i